  <description
  >CARES Risk Detection, mock sentiment context (D-083). Read-only. Returns whether a recent, genuine negative sentiment is on file for the contact (Has_Open_Context__c = true, inside the lookback window). Any problem (blank input, bad window, query fault) returns no context: a missing signal never grants the retention bonus.</description>
  <environments>Default</environments>
